            "title": "Lead Facial & Acne Licensed Esthetician | Certified Acne Expert",
            "bio": "Felicia knows how frustrating and isolating acne can feel. \n\nAfter years of dealing with breakouts, she turned her personal experience into a career focused on understanding, education, and real results. She creates a welcoming space where clients feel seen, supported, and confident in their skin.\n\nOriginally from a small town in Pennsylvania, Felicia moved to Illinois to be with her husband and is a proud mom to a little boy who lights up her world. Her go-to treat? A grande iced white chocolate mocha and a warmed-up chocolate croissant from Starbucks.\n\nFelicia is especially passionate about working with sensitive, reactive skin. Her favorite product is Quiet Wash from Hale & Hush, and she loves building customized facials that match each client's unique needs.\n\nFelicia's availability:\nMonday & Tuesday 10:30-6 | Wednesday - Friday 9:30–4:30 | Select Saturdays 9–1",
            "book_text": "BOOK WITH FELICIA",
            "book_url": "https://booking.mangomint.com/314399"
